    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu kūsanyiwa na ise būgonzo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu aho washishiwa ī Misili, muna Misili ūmò ntūmami wa ng'wa Falao, walī ntaale wa balang'hani, lina lyakwe Potifali, ūngūla ū kū Baishimaeli abo baalī bantwala ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA walī hamò nang'hwe ū Yosefu, na lūūlū ūng'wīlūkīla ningī no aho alī ū mu kaya ya ng'wa ise būgonzo, ū muna Misili ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise būgonzo aho wabona gīkī ū SEEBA alī hamò nū Yosefu, nī gīkī ū mu yose īyo wītaga ū SEEBA wangunanhaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akanyegela no; ūng'wīta kūbiza ngunanhi wakwe. Nīyo ū Potifali ūntūūla kūbiza nang'hani wa kaya yakwe yose; nī shikolo shakwe īsho walī nasho, ī shose ūshitūūla mu makono ga ng'wa Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma ikanza īlo akantūūla kūbiza nang'hani wa kaya yakwe, na wa shose īsho walī nasho, ū SEEBA wīfuuha ī kaya ya muna Misili ng'wenūyo, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Yosefu. Ī ja ng'wa SEEBA jūbiza kū būlī shikolo īsho walī nasho ū Potifali; pye hose hose, mu kaya nū kū malaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī shikolo īsho walī nasho ūshileka pye mu makono ga ng'wa Yosefu; na kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Yosefu, ū wei ooya gete ū kwikala akūkoya koyaga na shikolo shose shose a ha kaya yakwe, ūlū ītī shilīwa dūhū īsho walyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu na nke wa ng'wa Potifali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū wei ū Yosefu walī n'ihanga isoga ū kūlola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū aho jabīta shikū akūtūmamaga hoi, ū nke wa ng'wa ise būgonzo ūng'wikūmva; ūng'wīla, “Nzūgū ūlaale nane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo akalema no, ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū nene ū mu kaya yenīyī nalī ntaale, ū baba būgonzo atakoyakoyelaga shose shose īsho shilī mu kaya īyī; būlī shikolo shakwe ashitūūlile mu nkono gwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kaya yenīyī atīho ntaale kūniheeba ū nene; na shitīho shikolo īsho anilemegije ū baba būgonzo ū mu numba īyī, ūlū ītī beebe iyene; nguno ū bebe ūlī nke wakwe. Na lūūlū nakūdūla ginehe ū kūng'wītīla shibi ū Mulungu ū mu mhayo gwa malofu gwenūyū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo nūūlū īkī walī wangūūmīīla ū Yosefu ū mu mhayo gwenūyū, alīyo nahene atazunije ū kūlaala nang'hwe; nūūlū ni kūhooya nang'hwe dūhū yaya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū lwise lūmò ū Yosefu wingīla ū mu kaya gīkī akabeeje milīmo yakwe īyo wītaga na kale, pye a batūmami a bangī baalī batīmo ū mu kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūndima ū Yosefu ī ligoodi lyakwe; ūng'wīla, “Nzūūgū ūlaale nane!” Alīyo wihuluguma, ūnekela ī ligoodi mu nkono gwakwe; ū wei ūpuluka hanze ūpeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma aho wabona gīkī ū Yosefu wapeelela hanze ūnekela ī ligoodi lyakwe mu nkono, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyoganya alitana batūmami bakwe ba mu kaya; ūbawīla, “Ka lolagi shi ī Lihebulania īlo twenhelilwe, lyabizagūtwibengeleja! Lyalī liza mu kaya ūmu, lyandya kūnigaagaanīla angū līlaale nane; nalema, nīyo nūyoganya na kūyoganya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ligwa nayoganya nalīīlīla n'ilaka lya h'igūlya, lyūpuluka ū mu numba lyūpeela; lyūnilekela ī ligoodi lyalo īlī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūlībīka ī ligoodi lya ng'wa Yosefu kūshisha wiza kaya ū ise būgonzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla, “Ī Lihebulania, ī lisese īlo ng'watwenhelile lyenīlī, lyalī lyaningīlīīlaga kwiza kūnibengeleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho nayoganya nalīīlīla n'ilaka lya h'igūlya, lyūpuluka ū mu numba lyūpeela, lyūnilekela ī ligoodi lyalo līīlī!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise būgonzo aho wigwa ū būsombooji bo nke wakwe ūbo akang'wīla; ī gīkī, “H'ūmo lyanīītīlaga ī lisese lyako ī lelo,” akapelana no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnsola ū Yosefu ūmponya mu jeela, ūmo balugalīlagwa batūmami ba ntemi; wikala mo ng'hana ū mu jeela yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA walī hamò nang'hwe ū Yosefu, ūng'wītīla yawiza no; ūng'wīta kūbiza wa kūyegelwa ū kū būtongi bo ntaale wa jeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntaale wa jeela ūntūūla ū Yosefu kūbiza higūlya yabo pye a bafungwa abo baalīmo ū mu jeela yenīyo; nī mihayo ī yīngī īyo yalī yigelile kwītwa ū mu jeela, wītūūla ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa jeela ng'wenūyo ooya ū kwikala akwiganikaga kwīlola ī mihayo īyo walī wītūūla mu makono ga ng'wa Yosefu; nguno ū SEEBA walī hamò nū Yosefu, na wang'winhaga būdūla wa kūbeeja chiza būlī nīmo ūyo wagwītaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
